    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/delian-league">Delian League</a> was founded in 478 BC on the island of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/delos">Delos</a> to continue the fight against the Persian Empire after the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-plataea">Battle of Plataea</a>.</li><li>Most members chose to pay a tax to the joint treasury rather than supply ships, and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/athens">Athens</a> used the funds to build up its own navy.</li><li>In 454 BC <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pericles">Pericles</a> moved the treasury from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/delos">Delos</a> to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/athens">Athens</a>, and tribute paid to the league funded building on the Acropolis, including the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/parthenon">Parthenon</a>.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p>League members swore to have the same friends and enemies and dropped ingots of iron into the sea to symbolize the permanence of their alliance.</p></aside>
    </section>

